    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S253SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S253EV0002",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Intro 2",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S253SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S253EV0002",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Advisor \n\u0022Milord, there is a very serious situation in the kingdom. It seems that all the villages under our control have revolted!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S253SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S253EV0002",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Advisor \n\u0022We must take back our cities by force, and find out who has caused this! First we must meet with the Chancellor of Clovis to discuss battle tactics.\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 1
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S253SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S253EV0003",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Intro 1",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S253SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S253EV0003",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Imperial Advisor \n\u0022Welcome, Milord. I am your Imperial Advisor. I am here to give you helpful advice on the complexities of running a kingdom.\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S253SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S253EV0003",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Imperial Advisor \n\u0022I first would suggest that you ready a party in the capital by moving units from the garrison into the moving party. You may then choose to move items from the vault into the moving party\u0027s inventory.\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 1
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S253SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S253EV0005",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Hag Tower Hint",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S253SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S253EV0005",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Advisor \n\u0022Milord! We can hear the most awful cries coming from the Hag Tower! No doubt some innocent soul is being tormented in there! It is our duty to save them!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S253SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S253UN0029",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Peasant",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S253SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S253EV0006",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Loot Hag Tower",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S253SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S253EV0006",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Isuel \n\u0022Thank you for liberating me, I thought I would never be set free. To thank you, allow me to spread the word of the Empire by planting rods wherever you command\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 1
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S253SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S253EV0006",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Advisor \n\u0022We can order the Arch Angel to fly throughout the land, planting rods next to resources to claim them as our own. That way, we may collect gold and mana without having a town next to it.\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 4
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S253SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S253EV0007",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Hint3- Goblin Empire",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S253SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S253EV0007",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Goblins \n\u0022Hey! Stay away! This is our special treasure! You can\u0027t have it! You make us angry!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S253SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S253EV0008",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Defend Village",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S253SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S253EV0008",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Villagers \n\u0022Run for your lives!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S253SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S253EV000a",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Hint4- Water Travel",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S253SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S253EV000a",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Advisor \n\u0022Travel over water is slow and perilous for leaders that cannot fly, Milord\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S253SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S253EV000b",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Hint4- Water Travel2",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S253SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S253EV000b",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Advisor \n\u0022Travel over water is slow and perilous for leaders that cannot fly, Milord\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S253SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S253EV000d",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Graveyard",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S253SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S253EV000d",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Graveyard Marauder \n\u0022Come into our graveyard...\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 1
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S253SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S253EV000e",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Runestone Mana",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S253SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S253EV000e",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Advisor \n\u0022Milord, there is a source of Runestone Mana ahead! We should send out an Arch-Angel to plant a rod next to it!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S253SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S253UN0032",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Thug",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S253SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S253EV0010",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Day4 Hint",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S253SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S253EV0010",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Advisor \n\u0022Milord, our scouts have reported that there is a small village to the north. Perhaps we should investigate this, as it would be an opportunity to expand our influence.\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S253SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S253UN0037",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Thug",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S253SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S253EV0017",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Empire Healing",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S253SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S253EV0018",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Empire Healing Message",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S253SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S253EV0018",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Statue \n\u0022Blessed are those who fight for the Highfather... If you are hurt, you will be healed now, and each time you come back to this place\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 1
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S253SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S253UN0046",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Goblin",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S253SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S253EV0023",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Goblin Spawn",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S253SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S253EV0024",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Thug Passage",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S253SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S253EV0024",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Thug \n\u0022You\u0027ll pay a steep price to get around me!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 2
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S253SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S253EV0028",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Capture Nepheris",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S253SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S253EV0028",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "\u0022To increase the defensive capabilities of this city, you must grow the city. Each new level of growth will boost by one the number garrison units that your city can hold. The defensive bonus of any units inside the city walls will also increase.\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S253SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S253UN004b",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Master Thug",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S253SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S253EV002a",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Capture Davon Fort",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S253SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S253EV002a",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Villagers \n\u0022You can take our lands from us, but we will eventually have our revenge!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S253SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S253UN004d",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Master Thug",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S253SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S253EV002c",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Orc Warning",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S253SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S253EV002c",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Advisor \n\u0022Beware, Milord, Orcs are extremely aggressive and quite a terror on the battlefield! They may attack if we stop near them.\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S253SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S253UN004f",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Spearman",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S253SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S253EV002d",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Greenskins Hideout",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S253SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S253EV002d",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Advisor \n\u0022There is a Greenskins fort here, Milord. They usually amass quite a good amount of gold from looting passers-by. But they can defend themselves quite well...\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S253SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S253UN0052",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Master Thug",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S253SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S253EV0030",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Day Goblins Appear",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S253SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S253EV0030",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Advisor \n\u0022Many goblins travel from the Northlands to our region for trade. They may even attack us if we are not careful!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 1
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S253SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S253EV0032",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Life Mana",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S253SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S253EV0032",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Advisor \n\u0022The strange crystal ahead is Life Mana, Milord, the source of our magical might!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S253SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S253EV0032",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Advisor \n\u0022To acquire a resource such as a gold mine or a mana crystal not under our control, we may claim it by sending out an Arch-Angel to plant a rod next to it.\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 1
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S253SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S253EV0033",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Hill Giant",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S253SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S253EV0033",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Hill Giant \n\u0022What do you want? I decide who trains here, and you don\u0027t look like you\u0027d stand a chance! Ha!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S253SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S253EV0035",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Potions Hint",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S253SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S253EV0035",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Advisor \n\u0022If anyone is hurt during the battle, they can be healed by using any type of healing potion, or revived using a Life potion. If a Temple is built in the capital, units may also be healed and revived in the capital or in any of your cities.\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S253SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S253EV0036",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Spells Hint",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S253SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S253EV0036",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Advisor \n\u0022Milord, after we have collected a good amount of mana, we may cast spells to help us and hinder our enemies. To do this, we must first construct the Magic Tower, if it has not already been built.\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S253SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S253EV0036",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Advisor \n\u0022To gain spells, we can research them in the capital. However, we may only research the spells after having collected the required amount of mana.\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 1
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S253SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S253EV0037",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Upgrade Hint",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S253SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S253EV0037",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Advisor \n\u0022When enough experience has been gained, our battle units may upgrade to a more powerful role. However, to upgrade, the respective upgrade structure must be built in the capital.\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S253SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S253EV0038",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Artifact Hint",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S253SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S253EV0038",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Advisor \n\u0022Milord, we should be on the lookout for treasure chests that may contain artifacts of special power or valuables. It appears that there is one ahead of us!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S253SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S253EV0039",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Disable Upgrade",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S253SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S253EV003a",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Hiring Hint",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S253SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S253EV003a",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Advisor \n\u0022Milord, although we have lost a great leader, we should not fret. We may hire another in the capital, for a fee.\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S253SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S253EV003b",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Goblin Treasure2",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S253SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S253EV003b",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Goblin \n\u0022Hey! Hey! Stay away from our treasure! Get away!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S253SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S253EV003c",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Merchant Hint",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S253SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S253EV003c",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Advisor \n\u0022There is a merchant\u0027s shop ahead, in case we have need of any supplies such as healing potions or other items.\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S253SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S253EV003d",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Hello Chancellor",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S253SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S253EV003d",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Chancellor of Clovis \n\u0022Welcome. I am the Chancellor of Clovis, and I am here to instruct you in battle tactics. I cannot stay long as I must rush to the border towns, but I will tell you what I know.\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S253SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S253EV003d",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Chancellor of Clovis \n\u0022The ranged units such as the Archer, Apprentice and Acolyte should be placed in the back row; so as to be protected by the sturdier units who are ready to fight at close range, such as the Squire and the Pegasus Knight.\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 1
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S253SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S253EV003d",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Chancellor of Clovis \n\u0022So remember: some units can only fight hand-to-hand, and they should be put in the front row. Other units have ranged attacks and are usually weaker therefore better in the back row. And always leave the capital with a full party!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 2
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S253SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S253EV003d",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Chancellor of Clovis \n\u0022And one more thing: To access objects such as leaders or the capital, simply double click on them. To view information about objects, right click on them.\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 4
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S253SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S253EV003e",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Goodbye Chancellor",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S253SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S253EV003f",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Fight Peasants",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S253SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S253EV003f",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Advisor \n\u0022Rioting peasants are approaching, they are trying to lay siege to the capital! We must stop them in the name of the Highfather! Remember the Chancellor\u0027s advice!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S253SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S253EV0041",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Goldmine",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S253SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S253EV0041",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Advisor \n\u0022This is a gold mine, Milord. It is already under our control.\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S253SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S253EV0043",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Win",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S253SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S253EV0043",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Advisor \n\u0022The revolting peasants have been forced into submission! The Empire rules over this land!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S253SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S253UN0067",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Goblin",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S253SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S253EV0045",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Training Camp Hint",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S253SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S253EV0045",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Advisor \n\u0022Milord, there is a training camp ahead. For a sum of gold, they will train our troops; they shall gain experience in the same way they would on the battlefield.\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S253SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S253EV0046",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Mage Tower Hint",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S253SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S253EV0046",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Advisor \n\u0022This is a Mage Tower, Milord. We may buy new spells from the mage for a sum of gold.\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S253SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S253EV0047",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Orc Encounter",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S253SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S253EV0047",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Orc \n\u0022What do you want? There\u0027s nothing for you Empire people down there... Just dirty Demons! Now scram! And stay away from my lucky treasure!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S253SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S253EV0048",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Infernal Mana",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S253SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S253EV0048",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Advisor \n\u0022Ahead of us is Infernal Mana, rising from the ground. We may harvest the mana by planting a rod next to it.\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S253SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S253EV0049",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Empire Healing Enabler",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S253SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S253EV004a",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Remove Mountains",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S253SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S253EV004a",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Advisor \n\u0022Milord! We have triggered a secret magic passage!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S253SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S253EV004b",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "High level warning",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S253SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S253EV004b",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "War Advisor \n\u0022Milord, there lies a particularly dangerous demon ahead of us\u2026 How can we know? If you right click on the party, you\u0027ll notice a small blue sword above his portrait.\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S253SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S253EV004b",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "War Advisor \n\u0022A blue sword indicates levels 5 to 10, an orange sword levels 10 to 15, and finally a red sword is a serious warning- level 15 and upwards!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 1
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S253SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S253UN0086",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Cultist",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
